                    "message": "Hi Benjamin,\n\nI encounter a below error message if inherit systemd, could you give me some suggestions?\n\nNOTE: Setscene tasks completed\nERROR: hr855xg2-bios-update-1.0-r0 do_package: SYSTEMD_SERVICE_hr855xg2-bios-update value bios-verify.service does not exist\nERROR: Logfile of failure stored in: /home/pengms1/openbmc_855_02/build/tmp/work/arm1176jzs-openbmc-linux-gnueabi/hr855xg2-bios-update/1.0-r0/temp/log.do_package.388858\nERROR: Task (/home/pengms1/openbmc_855_02/meta-lenovo/meta-hr855xg2/recipes-phosphor/lenovo-fw-update/hr855xg2-bios-update.bb:do_package) failed with exit code '1'"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-hr855xg2/recipes-phosphor/lenovo-fw-update/hr855xg2-bios-update.bb",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Benjamin Fair",
                        "email": "benjaminfair@google.com",
                        "username": "BenjaminFair"
                    },
                    "message": "Looks like you do need obmc-phosphor-systemd then :)\n\nThe base systemd class doesn't install service files for you automatically, because it's expecting another build system to do that. In this case there isn't another build system to install the files."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-hr855xg2/recipes-phosphor/lenovo-fw-update/hr855xg2-bios-update.bb",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Peng",
                        "email": "pengms1@lenovo.com",
                        "username": "pengms1"
                    },
                    "message": "Ack"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-hr855xg2/recipes-phosphor/lenovo-fw-update/hr855xg2-bmc-update.bb",
                    "line": 3,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Benjamin Fair",
                        "email": "benjaminfair@google.com",
                        "username": "BenjaminFair"
                    },
                    "message": "not needed"
                },
                {
